 S~S  Recalling the purpose of publishing template documents in the first place.

------------------------------------------

    Over Time, while working on a single project, or a set of related or unrelated projects, a
    developer will migrate the style and content of information towards those with shared knowledge.

    A team of developers, all migrating over Time, are interacting with other consumers inside and
    the outside the development organization: QA, user document publishers, web page designers, etc.

    This is why the most defined and constrictive work writing requirements are about the metadata.

